{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"九年春，毛伯來求金。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"夫人姜氏如齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"二月，叔孫得臣如京師。辛丑，葬襄王。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"晉人殺其大夫先都。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"三月，夫人姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"晉人殺其大夫士縠及箕鄭父。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"公子遂會晉人、宋人、衛人、許人救鄭。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"夏，狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"秋八月，曹伯襄卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"九月癸西，地震。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"冬，楚子使椒來聘。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"秦人來歸僖公、成風之襚。葬曹共公。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"九年春王正月己酉，使賊殺先克。乙丑，晉人殺先都，梁益耳。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"毛伯衛來求金，非禮也。不書王命，未葬也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"二月莊叔如周。葬襄王。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"三月甲戌，晉人殺箕鄭父、士縠、蒯得。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"范山言於楚子曰：「晉君少，不在諸侯，北方可圖也。」楚子師于狼淵以伐鄭，囚公子堅、公子尨及樂耳。鄭及楚平。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_21","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"公子遂會晉趙盾、宋華耦、衛孔達、許大夫救鄭，不及楚師。卿不書，緩也，以懲不恪。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_22","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"夏，楚侵陳，克壺丘，以其服於晉也。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_23","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"秋，楚公子朱自東夷伐陳，陳人敗之，獲公子茷。陳懼，乃及楚平。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_24","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"冬，楚子越椒來聘，執幣傲。叔仲惠伯曰：「是必滅若敖氏之宗。傲其先君，神弗福也。」","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_ttr_105_25","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_105","textTraditional":"秦人來歸僖公、成風之襚，禮也。諸侯相弔賀也，雖不當事，苟有禮焉，書也，以無忘舊好。","sentenceOrder":25}],"overrides":{}}